OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy periods with brighter
OL,6,Fspells throughout the day. Most areas
OL,7,Fremaining dry, although the south
OL,8,Fcoast likely seeing thicker and more
OL,9,Fpersistent cloud, with outbreaks of
OL,10,Flight rain. Breezy along the coast.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FGenerally cloudy but dry
OL,13,Fovernight with a brisk easterly wind
OL,14,Fnear the coast. Becoming cold through
OL,15,Fthe night with a frost possible by
OL,16,Fdawn over higher ground.
OL,17,
OL,18,CThursday:FRather cloudy but dry
OL,19,Fthrough Thursday. Perhaps a few
OL,20,Fbrighter spells during the afternoon.
OL,21,FTurning cold and frosty overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
